# Food Share - Leftover Food Sharing Application

This application connects restaurants, event organizers, and individuals with extra food to NGOs and people in need, minimizing food wastage.

## Key Features:
- User Registration & Login (Donors & Receivers)
- Add Leftover Food Items (Quantity, Expiry Time, Location)
- Browse Available Food Content
- Claim / Request Food Cart System
- Delivery / Pickup Coordination Tracker
